content.text:
{
  "key": "pr-1785",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "feat(apps): bump js_widget_runtime 0.4.180 (QuickJS Native Assets) + wire onGestureEvent (#1784)",
    "description": "Closes #1784

- Bumps `js_widget_runtime` to `0.4.180` and `quickjs_runtime` to `0.4.2` (bundled QuickJS Native Assets with synchronous FFI host calls and binary lane on all VM platforms).
- Store / codesigning hardening in `quickjs_runtime 0.4.2`:
  - Android: `-Wl,-z,max-page-size=16384` for Google Play 16 KB page-size alignment gate (`verify_aab_native_libs.sh`).
  - iOS / macOS: `-headerpad_max_install_names -install_name @rpath/libquickjs_bridge.dylib` for Xcode Native Assets framework embedding & App Store / TestFlight codesigning.
  - Updates `scripts/size_budget/fa-ios.tsv` and `scripts/size_budget/fa-macos-arm64.tsv` baselines for `quickjs_bridge.framework`.
- Wires `onGestureEvent` to `engine.dispatchHostEvent('gesture:$actionId', payload)` in `JsAppView`, `DynamicWidgetCanvas`, and interactive `AppTileHost` so high-frequency pan/scroll streams bypass the serialized `callEvent` queue (#1784), pinned by `test/jsr_voxel_world_pin_guard_test.dart` and widget tests."
  }
}

